<title>FINLAND: Inreko Ships to start Tallinn-Helsinki routes.</title>
<headline>Inreko Ships to start Tallinn-Helsinki routes.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian passenger ferry operator Inreko Ships will start sea traffic between the Estonian and Finnish capitals on Thursday, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;M/S Vana Tallin starts cruise and scheduled traffic between Helsinki and Tallin on December 12,&quot; Inreko Ships Ltd said.</p>
<p>The venture is financed by Tallinna Pank and other Estonian banks, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
